flowchart LR
    Client[Customer/Admin client or Postman] -->|JSON + Bearer JWT| Gin[Gin REST API]
    MockProvider[Simulated provider state] -->|Outcome becomes SUCCESS/FAILED| ProviderLedger[(mock_provider_transactions)]
    Gin --> Middleware[Request validation, request ID, role checks]
    Middleware --> Handlers[Handlers and HTTP DTOs]
    Handlers --> Services[Order, product, inventory and payment services]
    Services --> Repositories[pgx repositories / transactions]
    Repositories --> DB[(PostgreSQL: source of truth)]
    DB --> Audit[Inventory movement audit]
    Services -. best-effort catalog cache .-> Redis[(Optional Redis with TTL/invalidation)]
    Worker[Periodic expiry + reconciliation workers] --> Services
    Worker --> DB
    Gin --> Metrics[/metrics: request counters + latency histogram/]
    CI[GitHub Actions: migrations, tests, race, vet, Docker smoke] -. validates commit .-> Gin
